### --------------------------- USERS -------------------------------
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### users filtered by address
GET http://localhost:3000/users?address=null

### users filtered by rol
GET http://localhost:3000/users?rol=client

### can be many filters at the same time
GET http://localhost:3000/users?address=barranquilla&rol=admin

### ---------- Auth by ID -----------
